bds 1,7 "Common usage GICB capability report"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Common usage GICB capability report. 24-bit map, one bit per
    common-usage BDS register the transponder reports via
    ground-initiated Comm-B.
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 Table A-2-25.

items

    CAPMAP "Capability Map"
        definition
            Capability bits for registers 0,5 0,6 0,7 0,8 0,9 0,A
            2,0 2,1 4,0 4,1 4,2 4,3 4,4 4,5 4,8 5,0 5,1 5,2 5,3
            5,4 5,5 5,6 5,F 6,0 in order, MSB first.
        element 24
            raw
        remark
            Decoded to a list of supported BDS register codes.

    spare 32
